                                "sense_id": "936b622c-145b-311d-9a90-cbc6392270aa",
                                "text": "I love this woman and her curvy body."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4942e41d-5fe4-4ec3-b237-0d0aae920820",
                                "sense_id": "936b622c-145b-311d-9a90-cbc6392270aa",
                                "text": "He tried to shift his focus back to Jessica and their wedding, but the soft, curvy blonde he'd met recently was stealing more and more of his attention."
